<BaseLayout title="UniTE — Unified Targeting Engine">
  <section id="unite-case-study" class="case-study">
  <h2>UniTE – Unified Targeting Expressions</h2>

  <h3>Strategic Challenge</h3>
    <p>
      Our ad exchange evaluated targeting expressions <strong>sequentially</strong>, with each new expression extending vertically. 
      Many expressions were later discarded due to <strong>user-level targeting evaluation</strong>, creating inefficiencies and limiting scale. 
      The problem was to <strong>scale targeting expression evaluation</strong> while also performing an <strong>overlap analysis</strong> between:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>The PMPs the exchange predicted a user would qualify for</li>
      <li>The audience memberships the user actually belonged to</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The challenge required designing a solution that <strong>improved throughput, optimized targeting decisions, and provided actionable insights for product and business teams</strong>.
    </p>


  <h3>My Role & Leadership</h3>
  <p>
    I led the initiative to <strong>define the product vision and roadmap</strong>, aligning engineering, data science, and business teams across multiple organizations. 
    I established success metrics, prioritized capabilities, and ensured alignment with <strong>industry standards for privacy and consent</strong>.
  </p>

  <h3>Impact & Outcomes</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Delivered a <strong>scalable framework for cross-publisher data collaboration</strong>, enabling partners to make data-driven decisions while remaining fully GDPR-compliant.</li>
    <li>Influenced adoption across multiple partner organizations, establishing <strong>best practices for data privacy and measurement in programmatic advertising</strong>.</li>
    <li>Presented the solution publicly, sharing insights with both <strong>technical and executive audiences</strong>, helping shape industry thinking.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Takeaway</h3>
  <p>
    Unite demonstrates how <strong>strategic product leadership and cross-functional collaboration</strong> can unlock value in complex ecosystems while maintaining compliance and trust.
  </p>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
